How we followed through",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How we followed through"}],[["$","p","Our event follow-up process included immediate feedback from close partners, personalized Luma messages, and a coordinated target list for BD and enterprise. We reviewed priority contacts together and considered where another event or collaboration would be useful.",{"children":"Our event follow-up process included immediate feedback from close partners, personalized Luma messages, and a coordinated target list for BD and enterprise. We reviewed priority contacts together and considered where another event or collaboration would be useful."}]]]}]]}]]}],"$L9","$La"]}]]}]
